  "document": "Jim Rogers (Oklahoma politician)\nJimmie Hugh Rogers Sr. (March 25, 1935 – November 11, 2014) was an American perennial political candidate. He ran for various offices and in 2010 was the Democratic Party nominee for the United States Senate in Oklahoma in a race against incumbent Senator Tom Coburn."
